# interfaces
.implements Landroidx/preference/Preference$OnPreferenceChangeListener;

# Settings > Miscellaneous (port_kit). Built in code from specs() (generated by lib/misc.py), so the
# apk's resources stay untouched.
#
# spec = "type|targets|title|summary"
#   C category      S switch      I information row
# targets = "table:key,table:key..." with table = system | secure | global | prop. A switch writes 1/0
# to every target; its state is read from the first one. The services/framework patches and the
# ColorOS apps read those keys themselves.


